Subject: Subread subjunc and featureCounts for small RNA sequencing data
Message-ID: <TgMhMvIiHqM.eJCnzlpxUx0J@subread.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/subread/c/TgMhMvIiHqM/m/eJCnzlpxUx0J>
